    {
      "source": "Create new <a href=\"ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExpressionDependencies</code></a> that contains all dependencies from this object and <code>other</code>. The\nmerged dependencies are guaranteed to not contain duplicates.",
