    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>ExpressionDependencies</code></a> holding a set of merged <a href=\"ExpressionDependencies.ExpressionDependency.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>dependencies</code></a> or\n        <a href=\"#none()\"><code>none</code></a> if the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html#isEmpty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>empty</code></a>.",
